{"route":{"id":"17480","name":"Passejada per Gualta i Fontanilles","intro":"Us descobrim una <strong>ruta breu</strong>, on podrem <strong>gaudir d’orquídies amb</strong> les seves esplèndides i <strong>encisadores flors</strong>, <strong>admirar</strong> les espectaculars <strong>vistes panoràmiques</strong> de la <strong>plana Empordanesa</strong> i visitar la imponent <strong>església Sant Martí de Fontanilles.</strong> Tot això i més ho anirem descobrint fent camí pels carrerons de Gualta i Fontanilles i mentre passegem entre els seus boscos i camps. Una<strong> experiència única per descobrir la bellesa que amaga la preciosa comarca del Baix Empordà</strong>, que ens revelarà el seu <strong>pluralisme</strong> entre<strong> mar, camps i muntanyes</strong>.","tipus":"Circular antihorari","dificultat":"Fàcil","durada":"2 hores","desnivell":"185.00 meters","distancia":"5.30 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Medi i arquitectura","imgs":["n17480_1.jpg","n17480_2.jpg","n17480_3.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-parc-natural-del-montgri-illes-medes-i-baix-ter/passejada-gualta-i-fontanilles","track":[[42.03048,3.10403],[42.03058,3.10399],[42.03062,3.10387],[42.03062,3.10375],[42.03057,3.10363],[42.03055,3.10349],[42.0306,3.10341],[42.03061,3.10327],[42.03055,3.10319],[42.03048,3.10319],[42.03043,3.10324],[42.03033,3.10316],[42.03023,3.10306],[42.03012,3.10302],[42.03001,3.10302],[42.02991,3.103],[42.02989,3.10284],[42.02987,3.10266],[42.02986,3.10247],[42.02983,3.10231],[42.02972,3.10232],[42.0296,3.10235],[42.02949,3.10239],[42.02935,3.10244],[42.02924,3.10248],[42.02915,3.10254],[42.0291,3.10232],[42.02908,3.10209],[42.02906,3.10188],[42.02905,3.10173],[42.02901,3.10152],[42.02894,3.10133],[42.0288,3.1013],[42.02869,3.10126],[42.02861,3.10115],[42.02858,3.10102],[42.02854,3.10093],[42.02849,3.10081],[42.02837,3.10076],[42.02826,3.10073],[42.02818,3.10068],[42.02806,3.10064],[42.02795,3.10059],[42.0278